# Normalise line endings so a contributor on Linux or macOS does not produce a
# diff where every line of a file appears changed.
# 統一換行符號，避免 Linux 或 macOS 的貢獻者送出「整個檔案每一行都改了」的假 diff。
#
# Text files are stored as LF in the repository and checked out with whatever
# the platform prefers. Binary files are never touched.
# 文字檔在 repo 裡一律存成 LF，簽出時依平台慣例轉換。二進位檔完全不動。

* text=auto

# Explicit, so these never get guessed wrong.
# 明確指定，避免被猜錯。
*.py    text diff=python
*.md    text
*.txt   text
*.toml  text
*.yml   text
*.cfg   text
LICENSE text

# Test fixtures are screenshots - binary, must never be line-ending converted.
# 測試素材是截圖 —— 二進位，絕對不能做換行轉換。
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.ico   binary
*.exe   binary
